# Hand-computed edge cases (my reading of SPEC.md).
### strict-limits-and-deadband
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 1 30
s 2 10
s 3 30.001
s 4 28
s 5 27.999
s 6 9.999
s 7 12
s 8 12.001
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@3:30.001
HIGH
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@5:27.999
LOW TO_LOW@6:9.999
LOW
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@8:12.001
