### faults-and-recovery
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=100
init 0
s 1 35
sf 2 36
s 3 nan
sf 4 20
tick 101
s 102 35
s 103 nan
s 104 20
tick 202
---
cfg
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@1:35.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@2:36.000
FAULT
FAULT
FAULT ESCALATE@101:20.000
HIGH TO_NORMAL@102:35.000 TO_HIGH@102:35.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@103:nan
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@104:20.000
NORMAL ESCALATE@202:20.000
